.git
.gitignore
.github
.planning
# ...except the approved subarea hierarchy drafts. pipeline_area_signals.subareas
# reads .planning/phases/04-subtopic-system/hierarchy_draft_<topic>.json from the
# image to assign grant and trial texts to subareas; without them every text
# goes unassigned (the run alerts WARN). Only the draft JSON, never the
# PLAN/SUMMARY siblings or POLICIES.md. The image must be built from a checkout
# that has the drafts (.planning/ is gitignored). Keep this re-include below
# `.planning`; .dockerignore is last-match-wins.
# tests/test_area_signals_subareas_image.py guards it.
!.planning/phases/04-subtopic-system/hierarchy_draft_*.json
.claude
.venv
venv
env
.env
.env.*
__pycache__
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.pyd
.pytest_cache
.mypy_cache
.ruff_cache
.coverage
htmlcov
tests
docs
# ...except the spotlight artifact schema. cli/backfill_spotlight.py reads
# `./docs/spotlight.schema.json` (SCHEMA_PATH, :59) at publish time (:1045),
# immediately before publish_artifact(). Excluding it makes every CONTAINERISED
# spotlight run die with FileNotFoundError at the last step -- invisible today
# only because all six real publishes were run by hand from a full checkout,
# never from the image. Keep this re-include below `docs`; .dockerignore is
# last-match-wins.
!docs/spotlight.schema.json
*.md
!README.md
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
.DS_Store
out
node_modules
*.log
.vscode
.idea
# A stray local BUILD_SHA must not name the image's build; use --build-arg BUILD_SHA (#407)
BUILD_SHA
